  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <lg xml:id="TolC087">
          <l>mutaṟciṉaik kiḷavik katuveṉ vēṟṟumai</l>
          <l>mutaṟkaṇ varinē ciṉaikkai varumē.</l>
        </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Iḷampūraṇar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Namaccivāya Mutaliyār</persName> 1931, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZMelJhy.TVA_BOK_0007521/page/69/mode/1up">69</ref>.</p>
      <p>
ic cūttiram eṉṉutaliṟṟō veṉiṉ, ‘ciṉainilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum’ [cūtti. <num xml:lang="en">2</num>] eṉṉum cūttirattiṟkup puṟaṉaṭai yuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        urai: 
mutalum ciṉaiyum toṭaruṅkāl mutaṟ poruṭkaṇ āṟāvatu varumēyeṉiṉ, ciṉaipporuṭku iraṇṭāvatu varuka eṉṟavāṟu.
      </p>
      <p>
        varalāṟu:
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Ilam-cit1">
        <l>‘yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ’
        </l>
      </lg>
      <p>
          eṉa varum. (4)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
        <head>Cēṉāvaraiyar</head>
        <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Ci. Vai. Tamōtarampiḷḷai</persName> 1868, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/tolkppiyamcollat00unse/page/n93/mode/1up">90</ref>.</p>
      <p>i-ḷ. mutaṟcollōṭu toṭarnta ciṉaiccolliṟku, āṟāmvēṟṟumai mutaṟkaṇ varumāyiṉ, ciṉaiccolliṉkaṇ iraṇṭāmvēṟṟumaiyē varum. e-ṟu.</p>
      <p>u-m.</p> 
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Cena-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>eṉa varum.</p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Cena-cit2">
        <l>"ciṉainilaik kiḷavik kaiyuṅ kaṇṇum"</l>
        <p>eṉṟataṉāṉ mutaṟciṉaikkiḷavikkum iraṇṭuvēṟṟumaiyumeytuvataṉai niyamittavāṟu. itu varuñcūttirattiṟkumokkum.</p>
      </lg>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Nacciṉārkkiṉiyar</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Irāma. Kōvintacāmipiḷḷai</persName> 1997, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZM3kZpy.TVA_BOK_0008472/page/n139/mode/1up">111</ref>.</p>
      <p>
urupu mayakkamāy varuvaṉavaṟṟaik kūṟumāṟu
      </p>
      <lg>
        <l>mutaṟciṉai kiḷavik katuveṉ vēṟṟumai</l>
        <l>mutaṟkaṇ variṉē ciṉaikkai varumē</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
iḵtu, urupu mayakkamāy varuvaṉavaṟṟaik kūṟumāṟu kūṟukiṉṟatu.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.) 
mutaṟciṉaik kiḷavikku ― mutaṟcolloṭu toṭarnta ciṉaiccolliṟku, atuveṉ vēṟṟumai mutaṟkaṇ variṉ ― āṟām vēṟṟumai mutaṟkaṇṇē <unclear>va</unclear>rumāyiṉ, ciṉaikku aivarum ― ciṉaiccolliṉka ṇiraṇṭām vēṟṟumai varumeṉṟavāru.
      </p>
      <p>
(u-m)
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Nacc-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa varum. iḵtu, orutoṭarkka ṇiraṇṭurupu varutaliṉ mayakkamāyiṟṟu.
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Teyvaccilaiyār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">1929, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n78/mode/1up">71</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/dli.jZY9lup2kZl6TuXGlZQdjZU1k0My.TVA_BOK_0007188/page/n79/mode/1up">72</ref>.</p>
    </body>
    <p>
      <note xml:lang="en"><persName xml:lang="ta">Teyvaccilaiyār</persName> considers this and the next verse to go together.</note>
  </p>
  </text>
  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>
      <head>Kallāṭaṉār</head>
      <p xml:lang="en">ed. <persName xml:lang="ta">Cuntaramūrtti</persName> 1964, <ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/83/mode/1up">83</ref>–<ref target="https://archive.org/details/TVG27Tolkappiyam/page/84/mode/1up">84</ref>.</p>
      <p>
eṉ - eṉiṉ, vēṟṟumaikkaṇṇatōr collutal vakaimai uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu. mēṟkūṟiya ciṉainilaik kiḷavi eṉpataṟkup puṟaṉaṭai eṉiṉum amaiyum. mutaṟporuṭkum mutalōṭu toṭarnta ciṉaipporuṭkum urupukaḷ varumāṟu kūṟiṉārām.
      </p>
      <p>
        (i-ḷ.)
atu eṉ vēṟṟumai mutaṟkaṇ variṉ ataṉ ciṉaikku iraṇṭām vēṟṟumai varum, (e - ṟu.)
      </p>
      <p>
        (e-ṭu.) 
      </p>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Kal-cit1">
        <l>yāṉaiyatu kōṭṭaik kuṟaittāṉ;</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:id="TolC087-Kal-cit2">
        <l>cāttaṉatu kaṇṇaik kuttiṉāṉ</l>
      </lg>
      <p>
eṉa varum. (4)
      </p>
    </body>
  </text>
